| T1  | 2026-02-05 | Harris Teeter | Assets:Checking    | -88.20 | Cleared   | none  |
| T1  | 2026-02-05 | Harris Teeter | Expenses:Groceries | 88.20  | Uncleared | none  |
Given import target is : ImportTarget Vertical
