When transactions imported : OfxTransactions
| TrnType | DatePosted | Amount  | FitId  | Name             | Memo | CheckNum |
| XFER    | 2026-04-11 | 1200.00 | CC-901 | PAYMENT RECEIVED | none | none     |
Then import summary is : ImportSummary Vertical
| New     | 0 |
| Matched | 1 |
Then postings are : ImportedPostingRow
| Ref | Date       | Payee     | Account                | Amount   | Cleared | FitId  |
| T1  | 2026-04-10 | CHASEBANK | Assets:Checking        | -1200.00 | Cleared | BNK-77 |
| T1  | 2026-04-10 | CHASEBANK | Liabilities:Chase Visa | 1200.00  | Cleared | CC-901 |
# One transaction, not two. The payee is still CHASEBANK -- the bank's word for
