Scenario Every proposal is confirmed in a dialog before anything is written
Description Nothing is paired without being shown and agreed to. The dialog
Description lists each proposal with both halves, the gap in days, and the
Description accounts, and offers approve, reject, and approve-and-remember.
Details A remembered rule can approve a later pair without asking again, and
Details that is the only path that pairs anything silently. It exists because
Details the user said so once, about those two payees in those two accounts.
