$WIP
Scenario The imported balance is checked against the one the bank states
Description LEDGERBAL is the strongest check there is that the import is right.
Description A disagreement is reported rather than silently accepted.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Bank    | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense | false       |
Given postings are : ImportedPostingRow
| Ref | Date       | Account         | Amount  | Cleared | FitId |
| T0  | 2024-01-01 | Assets:Checking | 1750.00 | Cleared | none  |
Given import target is : ImportTarget Vertical
| AccountPath | Assets:Checking |
When transactions imported : OfxTransactions
| TrnType | DatePosted | Amount | FitId       | Name          | Memo | CheckNum |
| DEBIT   | 2024-01-15 | -45.00 | 20240115001 | HARRIS TEETER | none | none     |
When ledger balance checked : LedgerBalanceCheck Vertical
| Account     | Assets:Checking |
| StatedBal   | 1705.00         |
| StatedBalAt | 2024-01-31      |
Then balance check is : LedgerBalanceResult Vertical
| ClearedBalance | 1705.00 |
| StatedBal      | 1705.00 |
| Difference     | 0.00    |
| Agrees         | true    |

